0:["uZlw_rSN16EBLe2H5Gx5t",[[["",{"children":[["slug","penarium-game-trailer-voice","d"],{"children":["__PAGE__?{\"slug\":\"penarium-game-trailer-voice\"}",{}]}]},"$undefined","$undefined",true],["",{"children":[["slug","penarium-game-trailer-voice","d"],{"children":["__PAGE__",{},[["$L1",[[["$","script","schema-0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$2"}}],["$","script","schema-1",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"@id\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/penarium-game-trailer-voice#breadcrumb\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"News & Blog\",\"item\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/voiceover-news\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Penarium Game Trailer Voice\",\"item\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/penarium-game-trailer-voice\"}]}"}}],["$","script","schema-2",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"VideoObject\",\"@id\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/penarium-game-trailer-voice#video\",\"name\":\"Penarium Game Trailer Voice\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/zxxR7tENfcE/maxresdefault.jpg\",\"embedUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/zxxR7tENfcE\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Guy Harris\",\"url\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/voiceoverguy\",\"image\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/images/guy-harris-profile.jpg\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"VoiceoverGuy\",\"url\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/images/guy-harris-voiceover.png\"}},\"inLanguage\":\"en-GB\",\"description\":\"Penarium Game Trailer Voice - I love this part of the voiceover business, the trailers. Self made miracle and TEAM 17 are launching this awesome game.\",\"uploadDate\":\"2015-08-01T00:00:00+00:00\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Penarium Game Trailer Voice"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>I got the call from Self Made Miracle and Team 17 asking if I'd like to be a part of this new project and of course I said yes. Would you like to be the Penarium game trailer voice? I said \"of course\". Session booked, mic live and away we went.</p>"}}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>So, what is Penarium?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p><em>Penarium is a frantic 2D arena arcade game where you control quirky anti-hero Willy. Willy is a kid trapped inside a sinister circus called the Penarium. Willy's only hope of ever returning to his beloved father's farm is to run, jump and avoid an array of killer deathtraps while being cheered on by a sadistic crowd that is out for blood; his blood.</em> I've provided the voice for quite a few <a href=\"/game-trailer-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Game Trailer Voiceover\">game trailers</a>, including <a href=\"/warwings-game-trailer-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Warwings\">Warwings</a> and <a href=\"/worms-wmd-character-voices\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Worms WMD\">Worms WMD</a>.</p>"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/zxxR7tENfcE","title":"Penarium Game Trailer Voice","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/penarium-game-trailer-voice.jpg","alt":"Penarium Game Trailer Voice","className":"blog-post-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Penarium Game Trailer</h2>\r\n<p>I love the game trailers. Getting the chance to be a part of an awesome game like this makes this job all the better. I am also playing the voice of the narrator in the game.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><em>Penarium is set in a unique world; a sinister circus show where contestants, much like gladiators, are forced to entertain a sadistic crowd at the risk of losing their lives. Guide poor little Willy through this evil madness and become the champion of Penarium! Every kid wants to go to the circus but no kid wants to die in one.</em></p>"}}]]}],[],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Get in touch</h2>\r\n<p>If you are looking for a voice for your game trailer or a <a href=\"/character-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\">character voice</a> for your game or app, then get in touch. To make the process even easier, just let me know the intended usage of the project and I can quote you more accurately. Feel free to send a short sample of the script and I'd be more than happy to send you a short audition to check if my voice is right for your brand.</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L4",null,{"pageTitle":"Penarium Game Trailer Voice","pageUrl":"penarium-game-trailer-voice"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L3","700",{"href":"/war-friends-army-voice